<title>POLAND: PPABANK TO LIST 1.25 MLN SHARES AUG 12.</title>
<headline>PPABANK TO LIST 1.25 MLN SHARES AUG 12.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw bourse will add 1.25 million shares  in PPABank SA to the five million already trading on August 12, bourse  deputy president Ryszard Czerniawski told reporters on Friday.</p>
<p>The shares are from a rights issue earlier this year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
